   "label": "b4dade78 Add Core 6 benchmarks and fix ",
   "title": "Add Core 6 benchmarks and fix doc examples\n\n- Add 6 new task YAMLs (09-14): factory-direct-uses, aggregation-modes,\n  save-load-roundtrip, configurations-recurrent-residual, data-semantics,\n  gcn-training-mode-forward.\n- graphnets.md: fix GNCellMLP example (int units, call before inspecting\n  all_weights), add graph_eval globals caveat and list-units warning.\n- graphs.md: replace broken GraphTuple.is_equal_by_value with field-wise\n  comparison; add -from+to / is_equal_by_value boundary notes.\n- backends.md: fix tf.concat axis and tf.is_finite for TF 2.21.\n- Regenerate api_index.json.\n",
